// Phase 6d — the three LMS agents, each with no tools (PHASES.md Phase 6 item 4, D-056).
//
// Before this, `agents` had no `list` and the gateway ran one built-in agent,
// `main`. Once a list exists, the list IS the set of agents — so `main` is
// named here, first, with `default: true`, or adding three agents would
// silently change which one answers. Nothing that runs today uses the lms-*
// agents: mail calls LM Studio directly from core/ with no tools at all.
// These are the topology Phase 7 (Telegram) routes into.
//
// Apply (on the Mac, from ~/lms-repo/lms) — see ops/PHASE6B_APPLY.md step 7:
//     cp ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.pre-phase6d
//     openclaw config patch --file ops/phase6d.patch.json5 --dry-run
//     openclaw config patch --file ops/phase6d.patch.json5
//     openclaw gateway restart
//     ./ops/agent_tools.py                      # proves each agent has no tools
//
// Shape from `openclaw config schema` (agents.list items), read Oct 3 2026.
// D-021 said tool policy is global only; that was true of `agents.<name>.tools`,
// which does not exist, but each agents.list entry DOES take `tools`.
//
// Idempotent — re-running changes nothing.

{
  agents: {
    list: [
      // Unchanged: same model (agents.defaults), same workspace, still default.
      { id: "main", default: true },

      {
        id: "lms-orchestrator",
        name: "LMS orchestrator",
        description: "Names the next pipeline step from a fixed enum; core/ runs it.",
        model: "lmstudio/qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mlx",          // TIER-L1
        workspace: "/Users/mleca/.openclaw/workspace-lms-orchestrator",
        skills: [],                                     // D-015: ready skills stay 0
        tools: { profile: "minimal", allow: [], deny: ["session_status"] },
      },
      {
        // The ingest sandbox: the only agent meant to read untrusted text.
        id: "lms-classifier",
        name: "LMS classifier",
        description: "Reads untrusted document text, returns schema-constrained JSON. No tools.",
        model: "lmstudio/qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mlx",          // TIER-L1
        workspace: "/Users/mleca/.openclaw/workspace-lms-classifier",
        skills: [],
        tools: { profile: "minimal", allow: [], deny: ["session_status"] },
      },
      {
        id: "lms-drafter",
        name: "LMS drafter",
        description: "Writes reply text only. core/ puts it in Gmail drafts; a human sends.",
        model: "lmstudio/qwen3.5-122b-a10b",            // TIER-L2
        workspace: "/Users/mleca/.openclaw/workspace-lms-drafter",
        skills: [],
        tools: { profile: "minimal", allow: [], deny: ["session_status"] },
      },
    ],
  },
}
